DESCRIPTION >
    - `cncf_collection_activities_copy.pipe` materializes CNCF-collection-scoped activity relations into `cncf_collection_activities_ds`.
    - Reads from `activityRelations_collection_deduplicated_cleaned_bucket_8_ds` filtered to `collectionSlug = 'cncf'` (`cityHash64('cncf') % 10 = 8`, so all CNCF rows land in bucket 8).
    - Runs daily at 06:15, well after bucket 8's clean/enrich copy pipe (`activityRelations_collection_bucket_clean_enrich_copy_pipe_8.pipe`, scheduled 04:40) finishes, so it always reads that day's fresh full-replace of bucket 8. 06:15 also avoids the dense job clustering in hours 00:00-05:00 (bucket cleanup/copy stages), landing in one of the lightest windows in the schedule.
    - Full-replace, since the upstream bucket is itself a daily full recompute (not append-safe).
    - Copies each contributor's and organization's place (country, else location) and whether the organization can appear in reports, so the country report pipes read one table instead of joining members and organizations per request.

TAGS "Report"

NODE cncf_collection_activities_copy_rows
SQL >
    SELECT organizationId, memberId, timestamp, platform, type, segmentId
    FROM activityRelations_collection_deduplicated_cleaned_bucket_8_ds
    WHERE collectionSlug = 'cncf'

NODE cncf_collection_activities_copy_member_places
SQL >
    SELECT id, upper(coalesce(nullIf(country, ''), location)) AS place
    FROM members_sorted
    WHERE id IN (SELECT memberId FROM cncf_collection_activities_copy_rows)

NODE cncf_collection_activities_copy_organization_places
SQL >
    SELECT
        id,
        upper(coalesce(nullIf(country, ''), location)) AS place,
        toUInt8(isAffiliationBlocked = 0 AND displayName != 'Individual - No Account') AS listed
    FROM organizations FINAL
    WHERE id IN (SELECT organizationId FROM cncf_collection_activities_copy_rows)

NODE cncf_collection_activities_copy_result
SQL >
    SELECT
        a.organizationId AS organizationId,
        a.memberId AS memberId,
        a.timestamp AS timestamp,
        a.platform AS platform,
        a.type AS type,
        a.segmentId AS segmentId,
        m.place AS memberPlace,
        o.place AS organizationPlace,
        o.listed AS organizationListed
    FROM cncf_collection_activities_copy_rows a
    LEFT JOIN cncf_collection_activities_copy_member_places m ON m.id = a.memberId
    LEFT JOIN cncf_collection_activities_copy_organization_places o ON o.id = a.organizationId

TYPE COPY
TARGET_DATASOURCE cncf_collection_activities_ds
COPY_MODE replace
COPY_SCHEDULE 15 6 * * *
